# Vendored Shape Enforcement Artifacts

This directory contains point-in-time snapshots of Databricks data-shape enforcement vocabularies.
All files are generated from the universe monorepo and are meant to be regenerated as needed.

## Files

- `static-shapes.json` (588 KB): Enumerated sets for ~51 shapes (generated by `//compliance/shape/java:static_shapes_json`)
- `release-step-names.json` (1.2 KB): Release-engineering step name vocabularies (generated by `//compliance/shape/java:release_step_names_json`)
- `jfr-thread-name-allowlist.txt` (8.2 KB): JFR thread name allowlist patterns (generated by `//compliance/shape/java:jfr_thread_name_allowlist_txt`)
- `cases.json` (180 KB): Shared corpus of test cases for parity validation (from `//compliance/shape/testdata:cases`)

## Regeneration

To update these artifacts, regenerate the universe build outputs:

```bash
cd /home/zhenchao.gan/universe
bazel build //compliance/shape/java:static_shapes_json \
           //compliance/shape/java:release_step_names_json \
           //compliance/shape/java:jfr_thread_name_allowlist_txt \
           //compliance/shape/testdata:cases
```

Then copy the outputs:

```bash
cp bazel-bin/compliance/shape/java/static-shapes.json src/shape/vendored/
cp bazel-bin/compliance/shape/java/release-step-names.json src/shape/vendored/
cp bazel-bin/compliance/shape/java/jfr-thread-name-allowlist.txt src/shape/vendored/
cp ../universe/compliance/shape/testdata/cases.json src/shape/vendored/
```

## Note on Drift

These are static snapshots. New shapes added to the universe source will not be reflected here
until the artifacts are regenerated. The shape validators remain compatible with new enum values
(they fail closed on unknown values rather than panic), so staleness is a graceful degradation
that keeps all unknown shapes as non-centralizable.
